<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal Sept prod price index rises 2.9 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Portugal Sept prod price index rises 2.9 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal's producer price index rose 2.9 percent year-on-year in September, while month-on-month it rose 0.1 percent, the National Statistics Institute (INE) said.</p>
<p>					 Sept 96     Aug 96     Sept 95</p>
<p>General Index			120.8	 120.6	 117.4</p>
<p>Percentage change yr/yr	  +2.9	  +3.1	   -</p>
<p>Percentage change mo/mo	  +0.1	  +0.3	   -</p>
<p>Accumulated 12 months	    +3.0	  +3.1	   -</p>
<p>Base Year = 1990</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
</text>
